  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Season the beef roast with salt, black pepper, and thyme",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat",
    "Sear the beef roast until browned on all sides",
    "Add the chopped onion to the pot and cook until softened",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the shiitake mushrooms to the pot and cook until they release their moisture",
    "Cover the pot and transfer it to the preheated oven",
    "Roast for 2 hours, or until the beef is tender",
    "Let the roast rest for 10 minutes before slicing and serving"
